{"v":4,"catch":"高速對決即將展開！","desc":"《ACE DRIVER》是 NAMCO LIMITED（現為 Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1994 年推出的賽車遊戲。\n透過令人屏息的賽道與真實的操控感，體驗賽車的精髓。\n根據你的玩家等級選擇車級，一路衝刺通關吧！誰才是真正的 ACE DRIVER！？\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-05-28","genres":["街機","競速"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/66657437a7932f3a6becceb372d42084a669e7b8c4501ee81bc1f2c9f39b9963.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b5804c228da09c9a9dc4a6bb080075b48030ffa7364f870d9e93c53c1c6cd10c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4ed6a7585a0f3122de3c2b65f2556a150258df214db286d0de80230db287e367.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7e52c727e807b684dcd9358f8f5979e5bb97f9e62138ee64270cc09322ef240d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9b56a7b6eb0db3e9852059ba1fdedf888c7e7058479c2a38086058392d0bc667.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c58b6baf96b0cddd36bc3abed6ff66f7e3680f77499acbd3f69eec79344a672.jpg"],"titleId":"0100db7023d0e000","dlc":[]}